Owner: trials-efficacy-intelligence
Purpose: evidence notes on Phase III pitavastatin/ezetimibe FDC efficacy, RACING (incl. DM
subgroup), HIJ-PROPER (incl. sitosterol/absorber-phenotype subgroup), and dose-comparison
(2 mg vs 4 mg; add-ezetimibe vs dose escalation) studies, each tagged with Evidence Hierarchy
and mapped to the Level 1/2/3 evidence framework in CLAUDE.md. Populated starting Wave 1/2.
